### Description

I have a schema that implements a date transformation as described in the docs [here](https://ai-sdk.dev/docs/ai-sdk-core/prompt-engineering#zod-dates). If I use this schema as the `inputSchema` of a `tool` definition, I get the following typescript error:

```typescript
// schema.ts

import { z } from 'zod';

export const alertsToolArgs = z.object({
  params: z.object({
    dateTo: z
      .string()
      .date()
      .transform((value) => new Date(value)),
  }),
});
```

```typescript
// tool.ts

import { tool } from 'ai';

import { alertsToolArgs } from './schema';

export const alertsTool = tool({
  name: 'alerts',
  description: 'Get a list of alerts',
  inputSchema: alertsToolArgs,
});

```

<img width="1738" height="511" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4073aa3e-76ed-47ca-b657-50297a85c3d8" />

If I remove the transform, it resolves the typescript error


### AI SDK Version

- ai: 5.0.8
- zod: 3.25.68
- typescript: 5.6.3
